# =============================================================
# .dockerignore – Hospital Management System (ASP.NET Web Forms)
# Rule: cz-dotnet-1040 – Unoptimized Web Forms Container Image Size
#
# Excludes PDB debug symbols, build artefacts, temp files, and
# development-only assets from the Docker build context to reduce
# Windows container image size on EKS.
#
# NOTE: Source files (.cs, .csproj, .sln) are intentionally NOT
# excluded here because the multi-stage Dockerfile build stage
# requires them to compile the application. The published output
# (Stage 2 runtime image) contains only the compiled artefacts.
# =============================================================

# ── Version control ──────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# ── Visual Studio IDE / tooling ──────────────────────────────
.vs/
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.vsp
*.vspx
*.sap

# ── Build output directories ─────────────────────────────────
# obj/ contains intermediate build artefacts (not needed in image)
**/obj/
**/bin/Debug/
**/bin/Release/

# ── PDB debug symbol files ───────────────────────────────────
# PDB files bloat Windows container images; strip from build context
**/*.pdb

# ── Temporary / cache files ───────────────────────────────────
**/*.cache
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
**/Temp/
**/tmp/
**/.tmp/
**/TemporaryGeneratedFile_*.cs

# ── Log files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/*.log
**/logs/

# ── Test projects and artefacts ───────────────────────────────
**/*Test*/
**/*Tests*/
**/*Spec*/
**/*.Test.dll
**/*.Tests.dll

# ── Documentation and non-runtime assets ─────────────────────
*.md
*.pdf
*.txt
LICENSE
README*
docs/
images/
Database\ Files/
*.sql

# ── CI/CD pipeline files ──────────────────────────────────────
.github/
.gitlab-ci.yml
azure-pipelines.yml
Jenkinsfile
*.sh
*.ps1

# ── Docker files (not needed inside the image) ────────────────
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore

# ── Node / front-end tooling (if present) ────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log
yarn-error.log
.npm/
.yarn/

# ── OS-generated files ────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db
